  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food Security and Rural Development - Sri Lanka</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Targeted communities will be more resilient in addressing adverse effects of climate change. Introducing new technologies and creating platforms involving community leaders, women &amp; youth to access and disseminate digital hydro-meteorological information and other useful practices to enable farming communities to mitigate possible environmental hazards, protection from floods &amp; droughts, and crop diseases and pest attacks. Special attention will be given children, youth mothers of pre-school children and people living with disabilities (PLWD).</narrative>
  </description>
